# Baseline Screenshots Directory
#
# Placeholder for baseline screenshots organized by tenant:
#
#   dialog-lk/        - Dialog (Sri Lanka) telco client
#   hutch-lk/         - Hutch (Sri Lanka) telco client
#   aia-lk/           - AIA (Sri Lanka) insurance client
#   aia-th/           - AIA (Thailand) insurance client
#   themes/            - Generic theme variants
#
# Screens are organized in subdirectories by screen/feature:
#
#   dialog-lk/
#     auth/           - Login, OTP, biometric
#     dashboard/       - Main dashboard screens
#     payments/        - Bill payment, recharge
#     connections/     - Multi-line management
#     profile/         - Settings, sign out
#
# Each screenshot should be named:
#   {screen-id}-{variant}-{theme}.png
#
# e.g., dashboard-balance-prepaid-light.png
#       login-otp-dark.png
#       policy-life-aia-lk-light.png
